<title>USA: New York physical copper market - July 29.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - July 29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for July shipment were quoted at a nominal 119.00 to 119.25 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 88.00 cents per lb, down 4.00 cents from July 28th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
